  "details": "VRChat Version: VRCSDK Avatars 3.2.0\n\nDescription of the bug:\n\nFlag whether foldout is opened or not should not be saved in prefab / scene files, should be saved in Editor or non-saved field instead.\n\nThis makes meaningless diffs in versioning system\n\nSteps to reproduce (how did you encounter the bug?):\n\n- Add some PhysBone component onto scene / prefab in project under git\n\n- Save that component & commit\n\n- Close/open some sections of PhysBone component\n\n- See git diff\n\n- There's meaningless diff about foldout.\n\nAny extra files? (output logs, screenshots):",
